\u003c/style>\u003cp>This guide walks you through creating a \u003cspan>Linode\u003c/span> in a core compute region using \u003cspan>Cloud Manager\u003c/span>. If you wish to create a \u003cspan>Linode\u003c/span> in a distributed compute region, see \u003ca href="/docs/create-compute-instance-distributed" target="" title="" class="doc-link" data-sidebar="create-compute-instance-distributed">Create a \u003cspan>Linode\u003c/span>  in a Distributed Compute Region\u003c/a>.\u003c/p>
\u003cp>To create a \u003cspan>Linode\u003c/span>, you will:\u003c/p>
\u003col>
\u003cli>\u003ca href="/docs/create-a-compute-instance#before-you-begin" target="" title="" class="doc-link" data-sidebar="create-a-compute-instance#before-you-begin">Review the Before you begin section\u003c/a>\u003c/li>
\u003cli>\u003ca href="/docs/create-a-compute-instance#open-the-create-form-in-cloud-manager" target="" title="" class="doc-link" data-sidebar="create-a-compute-instance#open-the-create-form-in-cloud-manager">Open the Create form in \u003cspan>Cloud Manager\u003c/span>\u003c/a>\u003c/li>
\u003cli>\u003ca href="/docs/create-a-compute-instance#select-a-region" target="" title="" class="doc-link" data-sidebar="create-a-compute-instance#select-a-region">Select a region\u003c/a>\u003c/li>
\u003cli>\u003ca href="/docs/create-a-compute-instance#choose-a-distribution-app-or-image" target="" title="" class="doc-link" data-sidebar="create-a-compute-instance#choose-a-distribution-app-or-image">Choose a distribution, app, or image\u003c/a>\u003c/li>
\u003cli>\u003ca href="/docs/create-a-compute-instance#choose-a-compute-instance-type-and-plan" target="" title="" class="doc-link" data-sidebar="create-a-compute-instance#choose-a-compute-instance-type-and-plan">Choose a plan\u003c/a>\u003c/li>
\u003cli>\u003ca href="/docs/create-a-compute-instance#set-the-label-add-tags-and-assign-to-a-placement-group" target="" title="" class="doc-link" data-sidebar="create-a-compute-instance#set-the-label-add-tags-and-assign-to-a-placement-group">Set the label, add tags, and assign to a placement group\u003c/a>\u003c/li>
\u003cli>\u003ca href="/docs/create-a-compute-instance#set-up-security" target="" title="" class="doc-link" data-sidebar="create-a-compute-instance#set-up-security">Set up security\u003c/a>\u003c/li>
\u003cli>\u003ca href="/docs/create-a-compute-instance#enable-or-disable-disk-encryption" target="" title="" class="doc-link" data-sidebar="create-a-compute-instance#enable-or-disable-disk-encryption">Enable or disable disk encryption\u003c/a>\u003c/li>
\u003cli>\u003ca href="/docs/create-a-compute-instance#add-user-data" target="" title="" class="doc-link" data-sidebar="create-a-compute-instance#add-user-data">Add user data\u003c/a>\u003c/li>
\u003cli>\u003ca href="/docs/create-a-compute-instance#set-up-networking" target="" title="" class="doc-link" data-sidebar="create-a-compute-instance#set-up-networking">Set up networking\u003c/a>\u003c/li>
\u003cli>\u003ca href="/docs/create-a-compute-instance#configure-additional-options" target="" title="" class="doc-link" data-sidebar="create-a-compute-instance#configure-additional-options">Configure additional options\u003c/a>\u003c/li>
\u003cli>\u003ca href="/docs/create-a-compute-instance#deploy-the-linode" target="" title="" class="doc-link" data-sidebar="create-a-compute-instance#deploy-the-linode">Deploy the \u003cspan>Linode\u003c/span>\u003c/a>\u003c/li>
\u003c/ol>
