\u003cul>
\u003cli>It's recommended to create firewalls and set default firewalls before creating Linodes. To create a firewall, see \u003ca href="/docs/create-a-cloud-firewall" target="" title="" class="doc-link" data-sidebar="create-a-cloud-firewall">Create a Cloud Firewall\u003c/a>. To set default firewalls, refer to the \u003ca href="/docs/select-default-firewalls-for-new-linodes" target="" title="" class="doc-link" data-sidebar="select-default-firewalls-for-new-linodes">Select default Cloud Firewalls for new Linodes\u003c/a> guide.\u003c/li>
\u003cli>Review the \u003ca href="/docs/set-up-and-secure-a-compute-instance" target="" title="" class="doc-link" data-sidebar="set-up-and-secure-a-compute-instance">Set up and secure a Linode\u003c/a> for all setup and security recommendations upon creating your Linode.\u003c/li>
\u003c/ul>
